  "tag": "v1.123.0",
  "body": "## Changelog   \n### ✨ Features   \n* 13ee9952: feat(df): fail closed on unparseable in-scope proxy traffic (Michael Eddington <redacted@example.invalid>)   \n* 2d427c3f: feat(repo): add --exclude-subgroup to group clone (Radek Antoniuk <redacted@example.invalid>)   \n* dcd1c99c: feat(skills): install remote orbit skill from the self-updating wrapper (Dmitry Gruzd <redacted@example.invalid>)   \n* c3151df7: feat(ssh-key): add --replace flag to ssh-key add (Radek Antoniuk <redacted@example.invalid>)   \n* 75a80123: feat: time tracking support on issue update (Giannis Kepas <redacted@example.invalid>)   \n### 🐛 Bug Fixes   \n* 1925cb6c: fix(api): send --input bodies as JSON unless a Content-Type is given (ANBUCHELVAN GANESAN CSE <redacted@example.invalid>)   \n* ba969f53: fix(auth): persist registry domains for token logins (Himanshu Jha <redacted@example.invalid>)   \n* 5d6ca7d5: fix(duo): keep missing binary versions empty (Himanshu Jha <redacted@example.invalid>)   \n* b06b06a9: fix(glrepo): skip fork candidates without local remotes (Himanshu Jha <redacted@example.invalid>)   \n* c80f417f: fix(issue): show the real total in the list header (unstable-code <redacted@example.invalid>)   \n* bb4e8108: fix(repo): correct default visibility in repo create help (Anish Kumar <redacted@example.invalid>)   \n### 📝 Documentation   \n* 8358d316: docs(contributing): update squash and merge link (sai krishna chowdary <redacted@example.invalid>)   \n* 6f1ec84c: docs: fix dead handbook and docs links in contributor docs (Anish Kumar <redacted@example.invalid>)   \n### 📦 Dependencies   \n* 372ed845: chore(deps): replace mgutz/ansi with local SGR codes (Radek Antoniuk <redacted@example.invalid>)   \n* dd610822: chore(deps): update module charm.land/bubbletea/v2 to v2.0.10 (GitLab Renovate Bot <redacted@example.invalid>)   \n* f758eb8e: chore(deps): update module gitlab.com/gitlab-org/api/client-go/v3 to v3.18.0 (GitLab Dependency Bot <redacted@example.invalid>)   \n* 65f7619a: chore(deps): update module golang.org/x/sync to v0.24.0 (GitLab Dependency Bot <redacted@example.invalid>)   \n* f2a00e54: chore(deps): update module k8s.io/client-go to v0.37.1 (GitLab Renovate Bot <redacted@example.invalid>)   \n### 🔧 Maintenance   \n* 392ad277: chore: remove redundant \"make fix\" tools (Ville Skyttä <redacted@example.invalid>)\n\n",
